 head, it is almost unrivaled. I've never heard of a headset specific for gamers that is wired and in-ear like this.\" class=\"ActionVideo__videoImage__MDnor\" style=\"background-image:url(https://img.youtube.com/vi/Hn-h4EWCosM/hqdefault.jpg);\"></div> <!----> <!----> <div class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionsItemContent__b+fib AwardVideoContent__reviewType__isoMH\"><p class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionTitle__9KMXz\">If you say that you love in-ear headphones rather than over the head, it is almost unrivaled. I've never heard of a headset specific for gamers that is wired and in-ear like this.</p></div></li></ul></div> <ul class=\"ProductAwardVideo__awardVideoMoreContainer__hZyzH\"><li class=\"ActionVideo__actionVideoContent__VSBOn ActionVideo__reviewVideo__ItQ8T ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewItem__r730n\"><button type=\"link\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"VideoButton__videoButton__XVz9e VideoButton__overviewVideoButton__d9DBl ActionVideo__videoBtn__bsfVJ\"><span class=\"sr-only\">play</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" svg-inline role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.24 12a14.32 14.32 0 0127.52 0h1.74a16 16 0 00-31 0zm27.52 8a14.32 14.32 0 01-27.52 0H.5a16 16 0 0031 0z\"></path></svg></button> <div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"If your priority is gaming, you can look at this headset.\" class=\"ActionVideo__videoImage__MDnor\" style=\"background-image:url(https://img.youtube.com/vi/3GNBHw60vXs/hqdefault.jpg);\"></div> <!----> <!----> <div class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionsItemContent__b+fib AwardVideoContent__reviewType__isoMH\"><p class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionTitle__9KMXz\">If your priority is gaming, you can look at this headset.</p></div></li></ul></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoMoreButton__h9Vas\"><div class=\"seeAllButton__seeAllButton__dIrKX seeAllButton__visible__OJDnB\"><button tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Xem tất cả Video review\" class=\"robotoFont seeAllButton__text__TNQDv\"><span>\n      Xem tất cả\n    </span> <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" svg-inline alt role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M6 9.55l-5-5V2.5l5 5 5-5v2.05l-5 5z\" fill=\"#181818\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-media\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Media_review\"><div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__productAwardPagePadding__LFeX-\"><div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__line__Z71fT\" style=\"display:;\"></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__awardMediaTitle__t55HQ\"><h2 class=\"pageMedia vnRogFont ProductAwardMedia__vnRogFontSize__ARdRa\">\n        Media review\n      </h2> <span style=\"display:;\">(8)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__mobileMediaContent__C6DyG\"><ul class=\"ProductAwardMedia__awardMediaContainer__M6cwI\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mega\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1261/202205091652439070934.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      Review tai nghe Asus ROG Cetra II - tai nghe chống ồn, tai nghe có dây đa nền tảng\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Mega\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>VIETNAM</span> <span>07/15/2022</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Cetra II media of Mega\" href=\"https://mega.com.vn/review-tai-nghe-asus-rog-cetra-ii-tai-nghe-chong-on-tot-nhat-2022.html\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"癮科技\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1349/202008240956539720471.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      採用 USB Type-C 數位介面的 ROG Cetra II 雖然論泛用性不及 3.5mm ，不過當前 USB Type-C 介面已逐漸成為手機與電腦的主流，不須安裝程式即可隨插即用並支援環境降噪功能，加上調音又是針對遊戲最佳化，對玩家也不需搭配外接 DAC 與耳機的組合，一根 USB Type-C 即可同時擁有具降噪的專業電競耳機，也是兼具 USB 數位介面與主動降噪技術的 ROG Cetra II 的特質所在\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      癮科技\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>TAIWAN</span> <span>07/19/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Cetra II media of 癮科技\" href=\"https://www.cool3c.com/article/163232\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"unikoshardware\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1349/202008240959381860617.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      小巧的設計搭配同級裡優秀的音質表現，ROG Cetra II 可說是 Cetra 系列耳機最佳信仰傳承代表，非常推薦給熱愛 ROG 信仰、同時又想要能夠將其隨身帶著走的玩家。\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      unikoshardware\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>TAIWAN</span> <span>07/20/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Cetra II media of unikoshardware\" href=\"https://unikoshardware.com/2021/07/rog-cetra-ii-review.html\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"電腦DIY\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1349/202103251555060670828.jpg);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      透過 ROG Cetra II  來聆聽流行音樂，可以感受到蠻強勁的低頻感，人聲舒適渾厚，幾乎可說在沒有 Run in 就有非常理想的表現！無論是 Lady Gaga 或是 Billie Eilish，你都可以感受到歌手迷人的歌喉，以及配樂的細節與強勁的節奏感！\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      電腦DIY\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>TAIWAN</span> <span>07/30/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Cetra II media of 電腦DIY\" href=\"https://www.computerdiy.com.tw/asus_rog-cetra-ii-core/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"XFastest\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1349/202206081842288470593.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      整體而言，ROG Cetra II 主打在極小的體積與僅 34 公克的重量，卻有著 AURA 燈效、隱藏式麥克風，以及 ANC 降躁的功能。尤其是 ANC 降躁還有環境模式，不需要將耳機摘下就能跟身旁的人進行溝通，一副輕巧的耳機就能滿足玩家在外使用的需求。目前這款耳機的售價在 3490 元，有興趣的玩家可以參考選購\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      XFastest\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>TAIWAN</span> <span>08/06/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Cetra II media of XFastest\" href=\"https://news.xfastest.com/review/review-09/99037/rog-cetra-ii-review/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"DOS/V POWER REPORT\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1283/202010221602487700444.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n       \n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      DOS/V POWER REPORT\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>JAPAN</span> <span>12/27/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Cetra II media of DOS/V POWER REPORT\" href=\"\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:none;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Everyeye.it\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1281/202008281747295780653.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      Thanks to the extensive ROG lineup, you can find the perfect headset for you.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Everyeye.it\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>ITALY</span> <span>06/28/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Cetra II media of Everyeye.it\" href=\"https://tech.everyeye.it/notizie/asus-rog-parliamo-nuova-linea-headset-gaming-526409.html\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"HARDWARE PLUS\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1352/202010212208235740501.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      If you say that you love in-ear headphones rather than over the head, it is almost unrivaled. I've never heard of a headset specific for gamers that is wired and in-ear like this.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      HARDWARE PLUS\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>Türkiye</span> <span>11/29/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Cetra II media of HARDWARE PLUS\" href=\"https://hwp.com.tr/rog-cetra-ii-inceleme-198596\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__rewardMoreButton__7-dJ4\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"seeAllButton__seeAllButton__dIrKX seeAllButton__visible__OJDnB\"><button tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Xem tất cả Media review\" class=\"robotoFont seeAllButton__text__TNQDv\"><span>\n      Xem tất cả\n    </span> <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" svg-inline alt role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M6 9.55l-5-5V2.5l5 5 5-5v2.05l-5 5z\" fill=\"#181818\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div> <script type=\"application/javascript\" src=\"https://rog.asus.com/rog/nuxtStatic/js/overview.js\"></script> <!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div> <!----> <!----></div></main>"}